      "label": "Teacher correcting student is mapped to 'see here's your mistake'",
      "description": "The text 'see here's your mistake' is overlaid on the image of the teacher pointing at the chalkboard, mapping the teacher's action of correction to the textual phrase. The teacher's gesture and the text together create an analogical mapping where the teacher's role as the corrector is explicitly linked to the phrase indicating a mistake.",
