      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_372fbc29",
      "@type": "SemioticProjection",
      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the student as the recipient of the abusive correction",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the student (the person being corrected) through the deictic pronouns 'your' and 'you' in the text overlays. The phrase 'see here's your mistake' directly addresses the student, and 'you added a fuck that i didnt give' explicitly targets the student as the one who made the error. This creates a semiotic projection where the viewer identifies with the student receiving the harsh feedback.",
